- Route Comparison: Compares available train routes so users can
  choose the most convenient option.
- Travel Time Estimates: Displays estimated journey times for
  different routes.
- Transfer Information: Shows where passengers need to change
  trains and which lines to take.
- Alternative Routes: Suggests other routes when a train line is
  delayed or disrupted.
- Delay Updates: Helps users identify possible service delays that
  may affect their journey.
- Commute Optimization: Recommends efficient routes to help reduce
  average travel time by 15%.
- User-Friendly Navigation: Presents route and journey information
  in a simple, easy-to-understand format.
Target Users
MyTrain is designed for students, workers, and travelers who use trains
for everyday transportation.
